      "message": "I\u0027m wondering if code somewhere will look at the creating UID and then assume that this network is somehow privileged because it was created by the system.\n\nDo we use this value somewhere? If not, is it better to use a different guard value here, like -1? (Other places in the code call that INVALID_UID).",
